  "evaluation": {
    "metrics": {
      "value": "Pass Rate（coverage≥0.75的任务比例）；Mean Coverage另报。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://labs.scale.com/leaderboard/mcp_atlas",
          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.00933",
          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scoring": {
      "value": "每条claim计0/0.5/1；任务coverage取均值，coverage≥0.75记通过，Pass Rate对任务取平均。论文v3主裁判Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview，并列GPT-5.4/Claude Opus 4.6敏感性实验；当前公开代码默认同为Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview。网页方法旧段仍写Gemini-2.5-Pro/temperature0，不能静默混为同协议。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2602.00933",
          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/scaleapi/mcp-atlas/main/README.md",
